=== AC3: Links display with configured properties (NOT EXERCISED) ===

Blocker: missing-test-data
Category: Build-time configuration

Reason:
  Same as AC1 - requires REACT_NAV_LINKS environment variable
  before building the application.

Manual verification documented in qa-plan.md:
  1. Set REACT_NAV_LINKS with external URL
  2. Rebuild application
  3. Verify link has external icon and opens in new tab
  4. Verify target='_blank' and rel='noopener noreferrer'

Code review evidence:
  - src/Utils/navLinks.tsx: processEnvNavLinks() detects external URLs
  - Adds ExternalLink icon for external links
  - Sets external: true for links starting with http:// or https://
  - src/components/ui/sidebar/nav-main.tsx: NavLink handles external attribute

Automated coverage:
  - tests/sidebar/navLinks.spec.ts validates external link handling

